{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One more gem </strong>is a love letter for\u00a0all the classic retro games <br>similar to <strong>Supaplex</strong> or <strong>Rocks'n'Diamonds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience solving intricate puzzles featuring new game elements,<br>all with modern graphics and a lot of shiny gems to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/a7693ee68b7fe231b649e2854e29b8dd.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as either \u2b29<strong>Moss</strong>\u2b29 or \u2b29<strong>Pebla</strong>\u2b29, protectors of their realm, <br>in a world where chaos broke out.<br>Follow the path of gems and help the realm heal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.webp?t=1766256026\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.poster.avif?t=1766256026\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The perilous worlds can be tackled in a multitude of ways<br>and they all come with additional bonus challenges,<br>featuring Steam achievements to boast your skills to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you become and expert you can come back to the same levels<br>and try to collect all gems as some of them are placed in challenging or tricky places,<br>making the original levels replayable and gives you a sense of accomplishment<br>when collecting all the possible gems in a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/76da7fccdd0686c9e5e0f8cccbf0c728.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The places you'll explore are not empty though,<br>they are filled with hungry monsters that are ready to hunt you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gradually as you progress the game introduces more elements<br>and more enemies for you to understand and tackle.<br>Initially you meet simple monsters with predictable movements,<br>while you progress the monsters are still predictable<br>but challenge your reaction time and logic in the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/4d1946652f36810f10f1d09c04608fff.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game features 7 level sets each,<br>with up to 20 levels in a total of 130 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some of the levels feature a boss puzzle where you have to tackle a snaking conundrum<br>that bends the original game mechanics in interesting ways.<br>There are eight types of snakes and worm, some are interesting, some are disgusting<br>but all of them bring interesting mechanics that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/c46375ece2b2f1bf2402de40d0b6ff55.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You always have one more gem to collect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Using the integrated level editor and sharing through Steam<br>you can share your levels with your friends<br>and challenge each other with your own creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/98f3b1b0ce3906554c930227ff34e6b0.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u02d7\u02cb\u02cf\u00a0<strong>Game features\u00a0</strong>\u02ce\u02ca\u02d7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Shiny modern graphics\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Smooth control\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Rewind time\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 <strong>130 Levels</strong>\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Multiple paths for levels\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Bonus challenges\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Eight music tracks\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Animated cutscenes \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Interesting NPCs \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Six monsters\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Eight snakes\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 56 game elements\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 <strong>Level editor</strong>\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Steam achievements\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 One more gem\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/1b0d322940b1d96722d52ee9652255a3f86c49de.jpg"},{"name":"Diamonds hurt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/c2e30e1b15db0610840ab12b03fd09299957af3c.jpg"},{"name":"Three in a row","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/20979196bd89c53a0ade6e40a471c840686e4c99.jpg"},{"name":"Gem school absolver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/8a5031076c839016c012d08dfad217597dbd6d51.jpg"},{"name":"Gem school collecter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/9b540aa309c2ffc8bc87b69f55c8987c1497cb17.jpg"},{"name":"Tricky but doable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/1ed414570995640020c611f8c224afb5be2f281c.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/3fc7161a6e88f28cfc7b35ecfe40fae25f93c6a3.jpg"},{"name":"No gem left behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/2ba4d45e57121c5ec6e752fead9d522e981c70de.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter elite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/0a45cbd65ba5c4ca61f9939d0e6ae96e33a27ed8.jpg"},{"name":"Swim up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871180/697dd4090879b740fc488b6a8b9b88efb7418bf5.jpg"}],"total":87},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871180?t=1766256026","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/5a79b1ce08af31ce4cb6e38124cf35b58f1dea93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766256026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/077b07fd4119b1fb3689ebf3bf82d47e7b6c3ddb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766256026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/077b07fd4119b1fb3689ebf3bf82d47e7b6c3ddb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766256026","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4031680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One more gem </strong>is a love letter for\u00a0all the classic retro games <br>similar to <strong>Supaplex</strong> or <strong>Rocks'n'Diamonds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience solving intricate puzzles featuring new game elements,<br>all with modern graphics and a lot of shiny gems to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/a7693ee68b7fe231b649e2854e29b8dd.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as either \u2b29<strong>Moss</strong>\u2b29 or \u2b29<strong>Pebla</strong>\u2b29, protectors of their realm, <br>in a world where chaos broke out.<br>Follow the path of gems and help the realm heal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.webp?t=1766256026\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.poster.avif?t=1766256026\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The perilous worlds can be tackled in a multitude of ways<br>and they all come with additional bonus challenges,<br>featuring Steam achievements to boast your skills to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you become and expert you can come back to the same levels<br>and try to collect all gems as some of them are placed in challenging or tricky places,<br>making the original levels replayable and gives you a sense of accomplishment<br>when collecting all the possible gems in a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/76da7fccdd0686c9e5e0f8cccbf0c728.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The places you'll explore are not empty though,<br>they are filled with hungry monsters that are ready to hunt you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gradually as you progress the game introduces more elements<br>and more enemies for you to understand and tackle.<br>Initially you meet simple monsters with predictable movements,<br>while you progress the monsters are still predictable<br>but challenge your reaction time and logic in the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/4d1946652f36810f10f1d09c04608fff.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game features 7 level sets each,<br>with up to 20 levels in a total of 130 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some of the levels feature a boss puzzle where you have to tackle a snaking conundrum<br>that bends the original game mechanics in interesting ways.<br>There are eight types of snakes and worm, some are interesting, some are disgusting<br>but all of them bring interesting mechanics that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/c46375ece2b2f1bf2402de40d0b6ff55.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You always have one more gem to collect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Using the integrated level editor and sharing through Steam<br>you can share your levels with your friends<br>and challenge each other with your own creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/98f3b1b0ce3906554c930227ff34e6b0.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u02d7\u02cb\u02cf\u00a0<strong>Game features\u00a0</strong>\u02ce\u02ca\u02d7</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Shiny modern graphics\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Smooth control\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Rewind time\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 <strong>130 Levels</strong>\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Multiple paths for levels\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Bonus challenges\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Eight music tracks\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Animated cutscenes \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Interesting NPCs \u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Six monsters\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Eight snakes\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 56 game elements\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 <strong>Level editor</strong>\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 Steam achievements\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2726 One more gem\u00a0\u2726</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3